{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_012","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"Robustly Monitoring for Payments","location_hint":"paragraph 51","char_start":1226,"char_end":1258,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_013","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"Robustly Monitoring for Payments","location_hint":"paragraph 70","char_start":1654,"char_end":1686,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_014","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 80","char_start":1855,"char_end":1885,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_015","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"The XRP Ledger enables you to make cross-currency payments of XRP and tokens. Cross-currency payments within the XRP Ledger are fully atomic, meaning the payment fully executes or no part of the payment executes at all.","location_hint":"paragraph 91","char_start":2143,"char_end":2362,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_016","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"By default, cross-currency payments deliver a fixed amount to their destination at a variable cost to their source. Cross-currency payments can also be partial payments that deliver a variable amount within a set sending limit.","location_hint":"paragraph 92","char_start":2364,"char_end":2591,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_017","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"By definition, a cross-currency payment involves at least two currencies, which means that at least one currency involved must be a non-XRP token .","location_hint":"paragraph 94","char_start":2610,"char_end":2757,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_018","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"There must be at least one Path between the sender and receiver, and the total liquidity across all paths must be enough to execute the payment. Cross-currency payments convert from one currency to another by consuming Offers in the XRP Ledger&#x27;s decentralized exchange .","location_hint":"paragraph 95","char_start":2759,"char_end":3034,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_019","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"Cross-currency payments that exchange one token for another token can automatically use XRP to bridge the tokens, when it decreases the cost of the payment. For example, a payment sending from USD to MXN automatically converts USD to XRP and then XRP to MXN if doing so is cheaper than converting USD to MXN directly. Larger trades can use a combination of direct (USD-MXN) and auto-bridged (USD-XRP-MXN) conversions.","location_hint":"paragraph 97","char_start":3053,"char_end":3470,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_020","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"For more information, see Auto-Bridging .","location_hint":"paragraph 98","char_start":3472,"char_end":3513,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_731c5d0b7dc0_021","source_id":"src_731c5d0b7dc0","source_hash":"3e3806c3a4178e6c63f4c5aac0db831a2fff9dd8ca12fdf115c0a66178e49e59","text":"Interpreting Metadata of Cross-Currency Payments","location_hint":"paragraph 108","char_start":3661,"char_end":3709,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:23:20.964Z"}
